@@ -863,9 +869,12 @@ fn ropeOf(e: *const Engine, lay: weights.Layer) prompt.Rope {
 
 /// The compressor's chain (a compressed layer): the RMSNorm alone at ratio 1; at ratio 2 the scatter of the rows
 /// into the group's raw slots, the memset of ch.invalid, the double gather back, compress2's
-/// weighted sum to bf16, the RMSNorm. One copy of the launches, run on `t`/`s`: the unforked path passes the main
-/// stream, the forked (TF_DS_COMPRESS_SIDE) path the chain's own (every launch rides `s`: the kit's through the
-/// stream-carrying Tri `t`, the ops and the memset through `s` directly, so the event ordering is total).
+/// weighted sum to bf16, the RMSNorm — or, at ratio 2 with TF_DS_FUSED_COMPRESS2=1 (set alike on both ranks), the
+/// scatter+gather+compress2 as one fused kernel launch (exact.compress2x; the memset stays out, its flag is dead).
+/// One copy of the launches, run on `t`/`s`: the unforked path passes the main stream, the forked
